Package: mlmCorrs
Title: Multilevel Correlation Matrices and Intraclass Correlations
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: person("Joseph", "Bonito", email = "jbonito@email.arizona.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates APA-style correlation tables (corstars(), optionally
    split by group), an intraclass-correlation table combining group-mean
    reliability estimates with a correlation matrix (icc.corrs()), and a
    two-level (within/between) correlation matrix fit via a saturated
    multilevel SEM (lgm()), for a set of numeric variables nested within
    clusters.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.2)
